                                 <p><strong>How can I check Personal Loan online eligibility criteria?</strong><br>

                                    <br>For checking loan eligibility all you have to do is visit the official Credify Capital website and click on the ‘Eligibility and Documents’ tab. You will find all eligibility requirements listed.

                                 </p>

                                 <p><strong>What are the eligibility criteria for a Personal Loan?</strong><br>

                                    <br>All applicants must have Indian citizenship, between 21 and 60 years of age at the time of loan maturity, have a monthly income of at least ₹30,000, have job experience of 1 year, and have current employment continuity at an approved company for at least 1 month.

                                 </p>

                                 <p><strong>What are the documents required for a Personal Loan?</strong><br>

                                    <br>Applicants must submit basic KYC, income, financial, and employment-related documents. You can access the list of documents required on our eligibility and documents page.

                                 </p>

                                 <p><strong>Can I get a Personal Loan without salary slips?</strong><br>

                                    <br>No, you cannot get a loan without submitting your salary slips. You are required to submit latest salary slip as part of the <a href="#">Personal Loan application</a> process.

                                 </p>

                                 <p><strong>Which proof of income is accepted for a loan application?</strong><br>

                                    <br>You need to submit the following as proof of income:

