                                       <li class="flex items-start gap-3 my-2"><span class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1"><img src="/img/documents-table-arrow.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="Last 3 salary credit bank statements original PDF, which should not be more than 15 days old." class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" /></span><div>Last 3 salary credit bank statements original PDF, which should not be more than 15 days old.</div></li>

                                    </ul>

